{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03852","headline":"和武三思於天中寺寻复礼上人之作 · 苏味道","name":"和武三思於天中寺寻复礼上人之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"藩戚三雍暇，禅居二室隈。\n忽闻从桂苑，移步践花台。\n敏学推多艺，高谈属辩才。\n是非宁滞着，空有掠嫌猜。\n五行幽机畅，三蕃妙键开。\n味同甘露洒，香似逆风来。\n砌古留方石，池清辨烧灰。\n人寻鹤洲返，月逐虎谿回。\n企躅瞻飞盖，攀游想渡杯。\n愿陪爲善乐，从此去尘埃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏味道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03852.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03852","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}